#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:1
msgid ""
"PLUMED Masterclass 22.9: Using path collective variables to find reaction "
"mechanisms in complex free energy landscapes"
msgstr ""
"PLUMED Masterclass 22.9：Path Collective Variables を用いて複雑な自由エネルギー地形上の "
"Reaction Mechanisms を探索する"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:3
msgid "Origin"
msgstr "作成について"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:5
msgid ""
"This masterclass was authored by Bernd Ensing on June 6, 2022. Much of this "
"exercise was originally created by Alberto Pérez de Alba Ortíz for the Cecam"
" School \"Understanding Molecular Simulation\", held annually in Amsterdam."
msgstr ""
"この Masterclass は Bernd Ensing が2022年6月6日に作成しました。演習の多くは、Amsterdam で毎年開催される "
"Cecam School「Understanding Molecular Simulation」のために Alberto Pérez de Alba "
