#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:10
msgid "Aims"
msgstr "目的"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:12
msgid ""
"The aim of this Masterclass is to demonstrate the advantages of path "
"collective variables for describing and simulating activated molecular "
"processes, and to provide hands-on experience with setting up, running, and "
"analyzing biased path-CV simulations, such as path-metadynamics."
msgstr ""
"この Masterclass の目的は、活性化を伴う分子過程の記述とシミュレーションに Path Collective Variables "
"を用いる利点を示し、Path-metadynamics など、Path-CV に Bias "
"を加えるシミュレーションの設定・実行・解析を実践することです。"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:18
msgid "Objectives"
msgstr "到達目標"

